Equation Listing    SOLVE PLANTING Using LP From line 84


---- REDUCE_DUAL  =E=  Reduce the acerage used each month

REDUCE_DUAL..  - 14000*Y(June) - 18000*Y(July) - 6000*Y(August) - 10000*Y(Total) + VRED =E= 0 ; (LHS = 0)
     

---- PLANT_CONSTRAINT_DUAL  =G=  Constraint of the value of the plant

PLANT_CONSTRAINT_DUAL(Hay)..  2*Y(June) + Y(July) + Y(August) + Y(Total) =G= 100 ; (LHS = 0, INFES = 100 ****)
     
PLANT_CONSTRAINT_DUAL(Grain)..  Y(June) + 2*Y(July) + Y(Total) =G= 120 ; (LHS = 0, INFES = 120 ****)
     
